profile: tinyrustlm.decisions.v1
updated_utc: 2026-06-29T22:59:10Z
decisions:
  - id: D001
    decision: Keep TinyRustLM as a plain PHP site, not WordPress.
    reason: User corrected the platform after the initial WordPress package.
  - id: D002
    decision: Preserve full report bodies under docs/reports and keep .uai memory pointer-first.
    reason: UAIX-style long-term memory should route to durable bodies rather than bulk-loading reports into hot memory.
  - id: D003
    decision: Add Docs + Memory top-menu group.
    reason: The site now has first-class documentation and UAI memory surfaces.
